    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b7Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, the \u201cDoctor\u201d, decides his actions by the choices made by the player, \u201cyou\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u201cDoctor\u201d, a psychiatrist, wakes up in a hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u201cDoctor\u201d has to take care of his patients for 5 days until they are discharged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the three patients are extremely sweet, extremely cute, and extremely \u201ctroublemakers\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A choice-type depressive game where the main character's ending changes depending on \u201cyour\u201d choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long duration (7-10 hours)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 NOMALEND, 4 GAMEOVER, 13 BADEND, 1 TRUEEND</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impressive BGM</p>",
